        "background": "black",
        "heading": "_Project Overview_",
        "body": "A fully AI-generated fashion campaign for Sunnei's Spiky Labauletto Leather Shoulder Bag — conceived, art-directed, and produced using generative AI from start to finish. The project explores what happens when creative vision meets cutting-edge image synthesis: a complete campaign ecosystem built without a traditional photoshoot, yet indistinguishable from one.\n\nThe result is a desert editorial — raw, sun-baked, and deliberately strange — that mirrors the bag's own contrasts:\nthe softness of leather against the aggression of green spikes, the luxury of Italian craftsmanship against the wildness of the Sonoran landscape.",
